# Operator-only root: state, variable values and build output stay on the
# operator's machine. The lock file is tracked here although the repository
# ignores it elsewhere, so every operator initialises the same provider builds.
/state/
/build/
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json
*.auto.tfvars
outputs.json
# A saved plan holds the instance id, account id and ARNs; OpenTofu writes
# crash.log with a state dump on a panic.
*.tfplan
*.plan
crash.log
crash.*.log
!.terraform.lock.hcl
